From: JorreFog <JorreFog@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] app: link X11 only when it is there

The app's CMake requires X11 on Linux, but no source calls an X11 function:
SDL3 opens X11 itself at run time where there is one. A Wayland-only
system without X11 stopped at configure ("Could NOT find X11"). Find it
optionally and link it when found.

--- a/vita3k/app/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/vita3k/app/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -21,6 +21,8 @@
 endif()
 
 if (LINUX)
-    find_package(X11 REQUIRED)
-    target_link_libraries(app PRIVATE ${X11_LIBRARIES})
+    find_package(X11)
+    if (X11_FOUND)
+        target_link_libraries(app PRIVATE ${X11_LIBRARIES})
+    endif()
 endif()
